          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And Abram took Sarai his wife, and Lot his brother's son, and all their possessions which they had gathered, and the persons that they had gotten in Haran; and they set forth to go to the land of Canaan. When they had come to the land of Canaan, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.12.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.12.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 12:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abram passed through the land to the place at Shechem, to the oak",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.12.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.12.6"
            ]
          }
        },
