            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.12.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " appeared to Abram, and said, “To your descendants I will give this land.” So he built there an altar to the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.12.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.12.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ", who had appeared to him. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.12.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.12.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
