              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Now there was a famine in the land. So Abram went down to Egypt to sojourn there, for the famine was severe in the land. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.12.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.12.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 12:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "When he was about to enter Egypt, he said to Sarai his wife, “I know that you are a woman beautiful to behold; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.12.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.12.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 12:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "and when the Egyptians see you, they will say, ‘This is his wife’; then they will kill me, but they will let you live. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.12.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.12.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 12:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Say you are my sister, that it may go well with me because of you, and that my life may be spared on your account.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.12.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.12.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 12:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "When Abram entered Egypt the Egyptians saw that the woman was very beautiful. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.12.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.12.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 12:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And when the princes of Pharaoh saw her, they praised her to Pharaoh. And the woman was taken into Pharaoh's house. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.12.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.12.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
